# Database migrations

Start PostgreSQL and configure the database connection in the project-root
`.env` file. Before starting the backend for the first time, run this command
from the `backend` directory:

```powershell
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m flask --app app db upgrade
```

This applies pending migrations, including the migration that creates the
`documents` table. Run the same command after pulling changes that add new
migrations.
